{"compatibility":"as-is","safety_note_md":"# SafeStan Safety Note

Compatibility: as-is.

Protected data: none. The program contains no model-block sampling statements and no observed data likelihood.

Generated files: `model_safe.stan`, `data_safe.json`.

No changes were required; all top-level data are context inputs used only to generate simulated quantities, and the program contains no parameters, no protected observations, and no arbitrary log-density manipulation.
","model_safe_stan":"data {
  int<lower=1> N;
  array[N + 1] real t;

  real x0;

  real mu;
  real<lower=0> gamma;
  real<lower=0> tau;
}

generated quantities {
  array[N + 1] real x;
  x[1] = x0;
  for (n in 1:N) {
    real decay = exp(-gamma * (t[n + 1] - t[n]));
    x[n + 1] = normal_rng(mu + (x[n] - mu) * decay, 0.7071 * tau * sqrt( (1 - decay) / gamma ) );
  }
}
","data_safe_json":"{"N":1,"gamma":3.474947360474734,"mu":3.415902697801133,"t":[1.0,2.0],"tau":2.039249044130223,"x0":6.860894094291081}","protected_variables":[]}
